== Notes ==

* Mantles do not absorb all spells, just the ones that check [[spell resistance]].
* This spell replaces earlier castings of itself, and it also displaces earlier castings of ''spell mantle'' and ''greater spell mantle''.
*The [[empower spell|empowered]] version of this spell occupies a level 7 [[spell slot]] and absorbs 10-15 spell levels before collapsing, which is similar to what is absorbed by ''[[spell mantle]]''. Mages with the empower spell feat &mdash; particularly [[sorcerer]]s, who have a limited spell selection &mdash; may want to use this spell (empowered) instead of ''spell mantle'', at least until ''spell mantle'' can be empowered.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''lesser spell breach'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

